            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.20.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Meetings: when only your microphone was recorded, the transcript now
      says so — everyone your mic picked up through the speakers is labelled
      You — with a link to check the System Audio Recording permission.
      Jarvis also keeps the reason system audio stopped, so the problem can
      be diagnosed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
